requirement\":\"Contents intact after growth\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-08713a6fed604aaa\"],\"summary\":\"sha256sum -c against pre-growth manifest reported all files OK, mount confirmed still active\"},{\"requirement\":\"Boot persistence setup (config only, not proof of restart)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-009be8ec555e411a\",\"cmd-eee0c2c1fbf8418d\",\"cmd-db3f90d3ee7d40a6\",\"cmd-c6052c3f60734386\"],\"summary\":\"Created loop-reattach script/service and fstab entry; verified systemd generated correct Requires/After ordering for srv-data.mount\"},{\"requirement\":\"Healthy baseline before restart (node1)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-37db93ca5ea6477b\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 377b5195..., LV size <2.15g, and checksum OK immediately before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"Restart acknowledgement returns before disconnect (node1)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-8acf2a4ecb694900\"],\"summary\":\"systemctl reboot launched via backgrounded nohup so the exec call returned 'reboot issued' before the node dropped\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart proof via changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-cc363f9d93ab4ab2\",\"cmd-caeadfe55c004416\",\"cmd-90eb660d609f4e5f\",\"cmd-35cec9b5aea944c6\",\"cmd-05cd1992357e436e\"],\"summary\":\"Connection timed out/reset during reboot, then exec succeeded again; boot_id changed from 377b5195-7fea-4219-a67b-044ef3f7ab99 to 2c39078e-edbc-4287-af4c-a23f8e113c4d, proving an actual restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 post-restart recovery of service/data/membership\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-05cd1992357e436e\"],\"summary\":\"After restart, /srv/data auto-mounted via systemd dependency chain, LV size still <2.15G, both PVs active in vgdata, and sha256sum -c reported all files OK\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"On node1, built a 2.15 GiB LVM logical volume (vgdata/lvdata) backed by two loop-mounted files (no spare block device existed on this VM), mounted it at /srv/data, grew it online from ~1000M to ~2.15G via vgextend+lvexten